Changes in this fork: the project is renamed from witchat to ghostchat, the
package, crate, asset and binary names are renamed, and the private group chat
feature (`/group ...`, the `ghostchat-protocol::group` wire module, the group
state machine in `ghostchat-core::groups`, sealed persistence in the app, and
the sidebar/thread UI) is new work in this fork. The group wire format is
byte-compatible with the iOS bitchat implementation so the two interoperate.
